                                "text": "Arr, matey! Tis a dangerous life, the sea – full of giant beasts, raging storms and wayward ships bobbing around like steel icebergs.",
                                "translation": "啊，伙计！海上的生活很危险——充满了巨兽、肆虐的风暴和像钢铁冰山一样摇摇欲坠的船只。"
